        </item>
        <item>
            <title><![CDATA[8.1.1 从规格到代码：解码器的本质（From Spec to Code）]]></title>
            <description><![CDATA[第六章建立的编码四环——预测、变换、量化、熵编码——在解码侧恰好镜像成一条反向流水线：]]></description>
            <link>https://arikanli.cyberfederal.io/Chapter_8/Language/cn/Docs_8_1_1.html</link>
            <guid isPermaLink="true">https://arikanli.cyberfederal.io/Chapter_8/Language/cn/Docs_8_1_1.html</guid>
